# Beat waits: the event arrives at the next whole beat, numbered by
# the main clock, so beats missed while busy show as a jump. Stop or
# close ends a wait with STOPPED. Cancel disarms it. Not playing:
# an error at once (the glue returns empty).
open virtual
arm
track 1 60:1
play continue
beatwait
beatwait
runto 5.5
beatwait
arm
cancel
runto 9
arm
arm
runto 10.5
arm
play stop
play continue
arm
close
